      <ul class="says">
        <li>Nothing stops a schema change from merging without review</li>
        <li>No test fails if a refund charges twice</li>
        <li>Deploys run migrations with no copy of the data to restore</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="verdict verdict-no">Not like this</p>
